## Symptom

Every non-ok register result carries the hardcoded human message alias conflict with existing lease (relay_server_json.ml:29-36): invalid_alias, alias_not_allowed, alias_identity_mismatch, and alias_conflict all share it (the error_code field is correct). Operators reading the message misdiagnose allowlist/pinning failures as conflicts. Also all register backend failures return HTTP 200 (respond_register_ok).

## Fix direction

Thread the backends actual status into the message; consider 409/403 statuses for conflict/mismatch.

## Evidence

Server-core review 2026-09-17.